{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは！\n新内眞衣です〜〜。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少し前に友達と\nアートアクアリウム展に\n行ってきました〜〜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2016/09/12/0606160/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっと行きたいなと思って\n数年経ってたんですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年はなんと10周年らしく...\nおめでとうございます！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とにかく綺麗で幻想的で\n凄く好きな空間だったな〜〜◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私的にとてもお気に入りなのは\n最後にあった金魚の屏風▼"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2016/09/12/0606160/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プロジェクターで写し出す絵に\n金魚と金魚の影が重なっていて\nほんと素晴らしい作品でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何時間でも見ていられたよ〜〜(^o^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普段、\n展覧会とかあまり行かないから\nこの機会にいろいろ\n行ってみよかっな！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何かオススメの展覧会とか\n博物館とかあったら教えてください◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎全国握手会"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりの握手会でしたね〜〜(^-^)/\nたくさんの方が来てくれて\n嬉しかったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ペアは伊織ちゃん♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ガールズルールでは\nペア握手がなかったから\n伊織とは何気に初めて！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めての方も\n伊織のファンの方\n新内ファンの方も\nありがとうございました〜〜m(_ _)m"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2016/09/12/0606160/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2016/09/12/0606160/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伊織とはね、\nよく変な顔して撮るの◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ラジオから来てくれる人が\n本当に多くて嬉しかったです〜〜(^-^)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また遊びにきてね〜〜◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎ANN0"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今週はのっけから\n(某)脱サラ・コナーさんの\nお話をしました〜〜◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"dope君聴いていたかな？？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして\n2推しのコーナーでは\n上司をネタにして"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"DJ Maiさんのコーナーでは\n親友をネタにして"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私のプライベートが危機ですね。\n聴いてないことを祈ります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来週こそは平和な放送を！（泣）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは今週も"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スタッフさんブログ\nhttp://www.allnightnippon.com/program/zero/wed/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"番組メールアドレス\nnogizaka@allnightnippon.com"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"LINE LIVEのアフタートーク#24"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"https://live.line.me/r/channels/231/upcoming/32818"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この日の三つ編みおさげが\n何気に好評で嬉しい◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来週もよろしくお願いしますm(_ _)m"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お知らせ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎乃木坂ゴルフ倶楽部♯2６\nhttp://video.rakuten.co.jp/content/151331/\n◎9/2 のぎ天 キャンプ回　後編　#7\nhttp://video.rakuten.co.jp/content/186506/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"br